:NOTE
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
Art. 1
1 This Act guarantees that persons settled or registered in Switzerland have free and equal access to the market anywhere in Switzerland in order to pursue their economic activity.
2 It aims in particular:
a. to facilitate professional mobility and trade and commerce within Switzerland;
b. to support the cantons in their efforts to harmonise conditions for market admission;
c. to increase the competitiveness of the Swiss national economy;
d. to consolidate economic cohesion in Switzerland.
3 An economic activity within the meaning of this Act is any non-governmental activity aimed at making a profit.
|

:NOTE
Para. 3 — Amended by No I of the FA of 16 Dec. 2005, in force since 1 July 2006 (AS 2006 2363 2366; BBl 2005 465).

